  "design": {
    "polynomial_type": "Symbolica UnivariatePolynomial<FloatField<Complex<Rational>>>",
    "formula": "For each row and channel: D(c+z) * derivative(P_i(z)) - sum_j A_ij(c+z) * P_j(z), including the existing channel shifts. Stored Float components and chart center are converted to exact rationals.",
    "operations": "Native Symbolica polynomial shifting, derivative, multiplication and subtraction; no custom convolution. Cache derivatives within the prototype.",
    "enclosure": "Outward-enclose each final exact rational component with native ComplexBall via the existing exact_ball helper, then reuse production denominator guards and defect_bounds.",
    "validation_boundary": "Prototype test inputs are bounded and checked by normal compilation/production-constructor comparisons. The test-only constructor omits production validation, cancellation and Result plumbing, so it is not a drop-in production implementation."
  },
